  "be worth doing 主动形式表被动含义：The book is worth reading.": "https://s-class-1403296481.cos.ap-chengdu.myqcloud.com/s-class/Grammar/L00-主系表与非谓语/assets/assets/tts-mp3/3e2737ec8fc4abb12ac5.mp3",
