  "It is + adj. + for/of sb. + to do ：作文与语法填空高频。": "https://s-class-1403296481.cos.ap-chengdu.myqcloud.com/s-class/Grammar/L00-主系表与非谓语/assets/assets/tts-mp3/7df4d2f9bd985f3c61e1.mp3",
